    {
      "type": "content",
      "section": "なぜ作ったのか",
      "title": "「あとで確認しよう」を「予定として見える」へ変える。",
      "lead": "分散した予定情報を自動で整理し、確認したものだけをGoogle Calendarに集約する。",
      "figure": {
        "viewBox": [1180, 420],
        "shapes": [
          {"kind": "roundRect", "x": 40, "y": 70, "w": 460, "h": 240, "radius": 14,
           "fill": "pale", "line": "grayLine",
           "lines": [{"text": "これまで", "size": 18, "bold": true, "color": "ink"},
                     {"text": "「あとで確認しよう」", "size": 22, "bold": true}]},
          {"kind": "arrow", "points": [[520, 190], [600, 190]], "color": "teal", "width": 3},
          {"kind": "roundRect", "x": 620, "y": 70, "w": 460, "h": 240, "radius": 14,
           "fill": "teal",
           "lines": [{"text": "これから", "size": 18, "bold": true},
                     {"text": "「予定として見える」", "size": 22, "bold": true}]},
          {"kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 335, "w": 1040, "h": 60,
           "text": "ひとつに統合する", "size": 17, "align": "c", "color": "ink"}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "section": "仕組み",
      "title": "AIで整理し、人が確認してから、Google Calendarへ。",
      "lead": "Google Calendarを唯一の正本とし、他のツールは「予定を集めるための入力元」として使う。",
      "figure": {
        "viewBox": [1180, 460],
        "shapes": [
          {"kind": "roundRect", "x": 20, "y": 40, "w": 250, "h": 260, "radius": 12,
           "fill": "pale", "line": "grayLine",
           "lines": [{"text": "入力元", "size": 19, "bold": true, "color": "teal"},
                     {"text": "LINE・音声・写真", "size": 16},
                     {"text": "学校PDF・伝助", "size": 16}]},
          {"kind": "arrow", "points": [[276, 170], [314, 170]], "color": "teal"},
          {"kind": "roundRect", "x": 320, "y": 40, "w": 250, "h": 260, "radius": 12,
           "fill": "pale", "line": "teal", "lineWidth": 2,
           "lines": [{"text": "Schedule Hub", "size": 19, "bold": true, "color": "teal"},
                     {"text": "AIが予定候補へ", "size": 16},
                     {"text": "整理", "size": 16}]},
          {"kind": "arrow", "points": [[576, 170], [614, 170]], "color": "teal"},
          {"kind": "roundRect", "x": 620, "y": 40, "w": 250, "h": 260, "radius": 12,
           "fill": "pale", "line": "teal", "lineWidth": 2,
           "lines": [{"text": "本人が確認", "size": 19, "bold": true, "color": "teal"},
                     {"text": "自動反映しない", "size": 16}]},
          {"kind": "arrow", "points": [[876, 170], [914, 170]], "color": "teal"},
          {"kind": "roundRect", "x": 920, "y": 40, "w": 240, "h": 260, "radius": 12,
           "fill": "teal",
           "lines": [{"text": "Google Calendar", "size": 18, "bold": true},
                     {"text": "唯一の正本", "size": 16}]},
          {"kind": "text", "x": 20, "y": 330, "w": 1140, "h": 100,
           "text": "確定後だけ作成・更新・削除／TimeTreeは読み取り専用",
           "size": 17, "align": "c", "color": "ink"}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "section": "仕組み",
      "title": "確認なしでカレンダーに入る予定は、ひとつもない。",
      "figure": {
        "viewBox": [1180, 440],
        "shapes": [
          {"kind": "roundRect", "x": 20, "y": 40, "w": 360, "h": 230, "radius": 14,
           "fill": "teal",
           "lines": [{"text": "確認なしの", "size": 20, "bold": true},
                     {"text": "登録なし", "size": 20, "bold": true}]},
          {"kind": "roundRect", "x": 410, "y": 40, "w": 360, "h": 230, "radius": 14,
           "fill": "teal",
           "lines": [{"text": "TimeTree・伝助へ", "size": 20, "bold": true},
                     {"text": "書き込まない", "size": 20, "bold": true}]},
          {"kind": "roundRect", "x": 800, "y": 40, "w": 360, "h": 230, "radius": 14,
           "fill": "teal",
           "lines": [{"text": "日時は", "size": 20, "bold": true},
                     {"text": "日本時間", "size": 20, "bold": true}]},
          {"kind": "roundRect", "x": 260, "y": 305, "w": 660, "h": 100, "radius": 10,
           "fill": "pale", "line": "teal",
           "text": "万一のときも7日間元に戻せる", "size": 19, "bold": true, "align": "c"}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "section": "実例",
      "title": "LINEの案内を、そのまま予定として使える形にする。",
      "lead": "タイトル・日付・時刻・場所を取り出し、最後は確認画面で直してから登録する。",
      "figure": {
        "viewBox": [1180, 480],
        "shapes": [
          {"kind": "roundRect", "x": 20, "y": 40, "w": 340, "h": 330, "radius": 12,
           "fill": "pale", "line": "grayLine",
           "lines": [{"text": "① LINEで届いた案内", "size": 17, "bold": true, "color": "teal"},
                     {"text": "「次回は夏合宿明け", "size": 16},
